# DockerU — Excluded Containers
#
# Container names listed here will NOT be auto-routed because they
# exist in multiple daemons. Use: dockeru -d <daemon> ... <container>
#
# Auto-detected duplicates are added by 'dockeru --refresh'.
# You may also add manual exclusions below.
#
# Example:
# komodo_periphery
# socket_proxy
# portainer_agent
